                    <!-- ── FracPlane Controller Panel (accordion) ──────────────────
                         FIX 2026-09-13: this whole panel (including the read-only
                         list and the 3D rendering of existing Frac Planes) used to
                         be wrapped in the admin/leader/user role check below. Any
                         other role (e.g. a Directional Engineer account tagged with
                         a different role string) got NONE of the panel's HTML at
                         all — and because wbtFPInit() (called unconditionally from
